e4chennutzungen spezifischer Fl\u00e4chen f\u00fcr Tunnel auf dem K\u00f6lner Stadtgebiet\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDie komplette Auflistung findet man hier:\u00a0\u003Ca href=\u0022http:\/\/www.stadt-koeln.de\/leben-in-koeln\/planen-bauen\/suche-im-flaechennutzungsplan\u0022\u003Ehttp:\/\/www.stadt-koeln.de\/leben-in-koeln\/planen-bauen\/suche-im-flaechenn..\u003C\/a\u003E\u00a0unter \u0022Filtern nach Fl\u00e4chen\u0022\u003C\/p\u003E","publisher":{"@type":"org:Organization","foaf_name":"Stadt K\u00f6ln"},"datasetseries":{"title":"Fl\u00e4chennutzungsplan K\u00f6ln"},"keyword":["Geo"],"politicalGeocodingLevelURI":[{"rdf_resource":"http:\/\/dcat-ap.de\/def\/politicalGeocoding\/Level\/municipality"}],"politicalGeocodingURI":[{"rdf_resource":"http:\/\/dcat-ap.de\/def\/politicalGeocoding\/districtKey\/05315"}],"dcattheme":[{"rdf_resource":"http:\/\/publications.europa.eu\/resource\/authority\/data-theme\/REGI"}],"distribution":[{"type":"dcat:Distribution","title":"FNP Tunnellage","dctModified":"2025-11-18T07:44:30+00:00","dct_license":"http:\/\/dcat-ap.de\/def\/licenses\/dl-zero-de\/2.0","dct_format":"http:\/\/publications.europa.eu\/resource\/authority\/file-type\/JSON","dcatapAvailability":{"rdf_resource":"http:\/\/publications.europa.eu\/resource\/authority\/planned-availability\/STABLE"},"dctIssued":"2016-07-12T10:13:24+00:00","downloadURL":"https:\/\/geoportal.stadt-koeln.de\/arcgis\/rest\/services\/planen_und_bauen\/flaechennutzungsplan\/MapServer\/1\/query?where=objectid+is+not+null\u0026amp;text=\u0026amp;objectIds=\u0026amp;time=\u0026amp;geometry=\u0026amp;geometryType=esriGeometryEnvelope\u0026amp;inSR=\u0026amp;spatialRel=esriSpatialRelIntersects\u0026amp;distance=\u0026amp;units=esriSRUnit_Foot\u0026amp;relationParam=\u0026amp;outFields=*\u0026amp;returnGeometry=true\u0026amp;returnTrueCurves=false\u0026amp;maxAllowableOffset=\u0026amp;geometryPrecision=\u0026amp;outSR=4326\u0026amp;havingClause=\u0026amp;returnIdsOnly=false\u0026amp;returnCountOnly=fals