zte Fl\u00e4chen )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFN_WALD_AA\u00a0( type: esriFieldTypeInteger , alias: Waldfl\u00e4chen )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFN_WASSER_AA\u00a0( type: esriFieldTypeInteger , alias: Wasserfl\u00e4chen )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFN_SONSTIGE_AA\u00a0( type: esriFieldTypeInteger , alias: Sonstige Fl\u00e4chen )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFN_BEBAUT_AP\u00a0( type: esriFieldTypeDouble , alias: Bebaute Fl\u00e4chen (%) )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFN_VERKEHR_AP\u00a0( type: esriFieldTypeDouble , alias: Verkehrsfl\u00e4chen (%) )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFN_PARK_AP\u00a0( type: esriFieldTypeDouble , alias: Parks, Gr\u00fcnanlagen, Sportpl\u00e4tze (%) )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFN_FRIEDHOF_AP\u00a0( type: esriFieldTypeDouble , alias: Friedh\u00f6fe (%) )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFN_LANDWIRT_AP\u00a0( type: esriFieldTypeDouble , alias: Landwirtschaftlich und g\u00e4rtn. genutzte Fl\u00e4chen (%) )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFN_WALD_AP\u00a0( type: esriFieldTypeDouble , alias: Waldfl\u00e4chen (%) )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFN_WASSER_AP\u00a0( type: esriFieldTypeDouble , alias: Wasserfl\u00e4chen (%) )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFN_SONSTIGE_AP\u00a0( type: esriFieldTypeDouble , alias: Sonstige Fl\u00e4chen (%) )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFeld-Appendix: _AA = aktuell absolut _AP = aktuell Prozentual \/ Quote _HA = historisch absolut _HP = historisch Prozentual \/ Quote\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","publisher":{"@type":"org:Organization","foaf_name":"Stadt K\u00f6ln"},"keyword":["Geo"],"politicalGeocodingLevelURI":[{"rdf_resource":"http:\/\/dcat-ap.de\/def\/politicalGeocoding\/Level\/municipality"}],"politicalGeocodingURI":[{"rdf_resource":"http:\/\/dcat-ap.de\/def\/politicalGeocoding\/districtKey\/05315"}],"dcattheme":[{"rdf_resource":"http:\/\/publications.europa.eu\/resource\/authority\/data-theme\/REGI"}],"distribution":[{"type":"dcat:Distribution","title":"Flaechennutzung Koeln 