ypeString, Alias: Name, Length: 26 )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EADRESSE (Type: esriFieldTypeString, Alias: Adresse, Length: 41 )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESTADTBEZIRK (Type: esriFieldTypeString, Alias: Stadtbezirk, Length: 25 )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESTADTTEIL (Type: esriFieldTypeString, Alias: Stadtteil, Length: 25 )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESTADTVIERTEL (Type: esriFieldTypeString, Alias: Stadtviertel, Length: 25 )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPOSTLEITZAHL (Type: esriFieldTypeString, Alias: Postzustellbezirk, Length: 5 )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHYPERLINK (Type: esriFieldTypeString, Alias: Link, Length: 75 )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENAME_LANG (Type: esriFieldTypeString, Alias: Langname, Length: 60 )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETRAEGER (Type: esriFieldTypeString, Alias: Tr\u00e4ger, Length: 20 )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EX_KOORDINATE (Type: esriFieldTypeDouble, Alias: X-Koordinate)\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EY_KOORDINATE (Type: esriFieldTypeDouble, Alias: Y-Koordinate)\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESHAPE (Type: esriFieldTypeGeometry, Alias: Shape)\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u00a0\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInformation:\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u00a0\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENeben den oben angegebenen X,Y Koordinaten mit dem Bezugssystem WGS_1984_UTM_Zone_32N, gibt es ein weiteres Feld \u0022geometry\u0022, welches die X\/Y Koordinaten im Bezugssystem WGS84 (EPSG:4326) ausgibt.\u003C\/p\u003E","publisher":{"@type":"org:Organization","foaf_name":"Stadt K\u00f6ln"},"keyword":["Geo","Kultur","Freizeit","Sport und Tourismus"],"politicalGeocodingLevelURI":[{"rdf_resource":"http:\/\/dcat-ap.de\/def\/politicalGeocoding\/Level\/municipality"}],"politicalGeocodingURI":[{"rdf_resource":"http:\/\/dcat-ap.de\/def\/politicalGeocoding\/districtKey\/05315"}],"dcattheme":[{"rdf_resource":"http:\/\/publications.europa.eu\/resource\/authority\/data-theme\/EDUC"}],"distribution":[{"type":"dcat:Dist