ype: esriFieldTypeString, Alias: Link, Length: 75 )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENAME_LANG (Type: esriFieldTypeString, Alias: Langname, Length: 60 )\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EX_KOORDINATE (Type: esriFieldTypeDouble, Alias: X-Koordinate)\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EY_KOORDINATE (Type: esriFieldTypeDouble, Alias: Y-Koordinate)\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESHAPE (Type: esriFieldTypeGeometry, Alias: Shape)\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u00a0\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EInformation:\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u00a0\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENeben den oben angegebenen X,Y Koordinaten mit dem Bezugssystem WGS_1984_UTM_Zone_32N, gibt es ein weiteres Feld \u0022geometry\u0022, welches die X\/Y Koordinaten im Bezugssystem WGS84 (EPSG:4326) ausgibt.\u003C\/p\u003E","publisher":{"@type":"org:Organization","foaf_name":"Stadt K\u00f6ln"},"keyword":["Geo","Kultur","Freizeit","Sport und Tourismus"],"politicalGeocodingLevelURI":[{"rdf_resource":"http:\/\/dcat-ap.de\/def\/politicalGeocoding\/Level\/municipality"}],"politicalGeocodingURI":[{"rdf_resource":"http:\/\/dcat-ap.de\/def\/politicalGeocoding\/districtKey\/05315"}],"dcattheme":[{"rdf_resource":"http:\/\/publications.europa.eu\/resource\/authority\/data-theme\/EDUC"}],"distribution":[{"type":"dcat:Distribution","title":"ArcGIS REST API Sehensw\u00fcrdigkeiten in K\u00f6ln","dctModified":"2025-10-14T11:36:54+00:00","dct_license":"http:\/\/dcat-ap.de\/def\/licenses\/dl-zero-de\/2.0","dct_format":"http:\/\/publications.europa.eu\/resource\/authority\/file-type\/JSON","dcatapAvailability":{"rdf_resource":"http:\/\/publications.europa.eu\/resource\/authority\/planned-availability\/STABLE"},"dctIssued":"2014-07-21T08:38:58+00:00","downloadURL":"https:\/\/geoportal.stadt-koeln.de\/arcgis\/rest\/services\/basiskarten\/stadtplanthemen\/MapServer\/7\/query?where=objectid+is+not+null\u0026amp;text=\u0026amp;objectIds=\u0026amp;time=\u0026amp;geometry=\u0026amp;geometryType=esriGeometryEnvelope\u0026amp;inSR=\u0026amp;s